  "description": "SIHTAG crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C62 H72 N4 O18 Tb4,C1 H4 O1. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb1F (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2F (Tb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.631-3.893 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 92.17-111.45°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C63H76N4O19Tb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
